          "durationMs": 4600
        },
        {
          "id": "rms_02",
          "tone": "venom",
          "text": "记是记了。{min}后我喊不喊，看心情。{what}——你自己也盯梢点。",
          "durationMs": 4800
        },
        {
          "id": "rms_03",
          "tone": "meta",
          "text": "记住了。{min}。{what}。……我数得比你准。",
